.TH koji-lag 1 2026-08-11 "sandogasa 0.19.2" "Sandogasa Manual"
.SH NAME
koji\-lag \- Quantify Koji build queue lag and per\-arch build\-time drag
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBkoji\-lag\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Quantify Koji build queue lag and per\-arch build\-time drag
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH COMMANDS
.SS koji-lag fetch
\fBkoji\-lag fetch\fR [\fB\-\-instance\fR] [\fB\-\-hub\-url\fR] [\fB\-\-since\fR] [\fB\-\-until\fR] [\fB\-\-days\fR] [\fB\-\-owner\fR] [\fB\-\-package\fR] [\fB\-i\fR|\fB\-\-inventory\fR] <\fB\-o\fR|\fB\-\-output\fR> [\fB\-\-page\-size\fR] [\fB\-\-sleep\-ms\fR] [\fB\-\-retries\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.PP
Sweep a Koji completion window into a local dataset
.TP
\fB\-\-instance\fR \fI<INSTANCE>\fR [default: fedora]
Known Koji instance (cbs, fedora, stream)
.TP
\fB\-\-hub\-url\fR \fI<URL>\fR
Explicit hub URL (overrides \-\-instance; https only)
.TP
\fB\-\-since\fR \fI<YYYY\-MM\-DD>\fR
Window start date (UTC midnight, inclusive)
.TP
\fB\-\-until\fR \fI<YYYY\-MM\-DD>\fR
Window end date, inclusive (default: the last complete UTC day — the running day is never included implicitly)
.TP
\fB\-\-days\fR \fI<N>\fR
Sweep the last N complete UTC days
.TP
\fB\-\-owner\fR \fI<NAME>\fR
Keep only builds submitted by this user
.TP
\fB\-\-package\fR \fI<NAME,...>\fR
Keep only these source packages (CSV or repeated)
.TP
\fB\-i\fR, \fB\-\-inventory\fR \fI<FILE>\fR
Keep only packages from these inventory files
.TP
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-output\fR \fI<FILE>\fR
Dataset file to create or merge into
.TP
\fB\-\-page\-size\fR \fI<PAGE_SIZE>\fR [default: 1000]
Tasks per listTasks page
.TP
\fB\-\-sleep\-ms\fR \fI<SLEEP_MS>\fR [default: 500]
Pause between hub requests, in milliseconds
.TP
\fB\-\-retries\fR \fI<RETRIES>\fR [default: 3]
Retries per failed hub request
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Print progress to stderr
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SS koji-lag merge
\fBkoji\-lag merge\fR <\fB\-o\fR|\fB\-\-output\fR> [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIFILE\fR> 
.PP
Union datasets collected independently into one
.TP
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-output\fR \fI<FILE>\fR
Merged output file
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIFILE\fR>
Dataset files to union
.SS koji-lag report
\fBkoji\-lag report\fR [\fB\-\-since\fR] [\fB\-\-until\fR] [\fB\-\-arch\fR] [\fB\-\-scratch\fR] [\fB\-\-official\fR] [\fB\-\-include\-failed\fR] [\fB\-\-min\-samples\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIFILE\fR> 
.PP
Per\-arch queue\-wait / build\-time / bottleneck report
.TP
\fB\-\-since\fR \fI<YYYY\-MM\-DD>\fR
Only tasks completing on/after this date (UTC midnight)
.TP
\fB\-\-until\fR \fI<YYYY\-MM\-DD>\fR
Only tasks completing on/before this date (UTC midnight)
.TP
\fB\-\-arch\fR \fI<ARCH,...>\fR
Restrict to these arches (CSV or repeated)
.TP
\fB\-\-scratch\fR
Only scratch builds
.TP
\fB\-\-official\fR
Only official (non\-scratch) builds
.TP
\fB\-\-include\-failed\fR
Include FAILED tasks in build\-time statistics
.TP
\fB\-\-min\-samples\fR \fI<MIN_SAMPLES>\fR [default: 5]
Withhold human\-output stats below this sample count
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Output machine\-readable JSON instead of tables
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIFILE\fR>
Dataset file(s) to report over (merged in memory)
